Things to handle
Adding marks for a student who doesn't exist yet — either reject it, or auto-create them (your choice, but be intentional).
Viewing average/highest/lowest for a student with zero marks — this would cause a ZeroDivisionError on the average calculation, so guard against it.

Bonus (optional)
Add a "Class Average" option (5) that shows the average of all students' overall averages.
